# Security

- Never commit `.env.local` or expose `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` / `BREVO_API_KEY` to the client
- Only `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` vars are browser-safe
- `createAdminClient()` is server-only; never bundle in client components
- Admin access requires `profiles.is_admin = true` — checked in middleware AND API routes
- Order creation must use server-side prices and stock — never trust cart prices from localStorage
- File uploads: validate MIME type and size server-side (already in upload route)
- Do not add public Supabase insert policies for orders — keep order writes in API routes
